# Local-only example. Create ignored .dev.vars.local; never commit its values.
# JWT_SECRET="generate-a-long-random-local-secret"
# EMAIL_CODE_PEPPER="generate-an-independent-random-local-pepper"
# EMAIL_FROM="SyncroEdit <verify@example.com>"
# APP_NAME="SyncroEdit"
# Real email delivery requires an independently scoped development RESEND_API_KEY.
# Production secrets remain in Cloudflare. See README.md and docs/DELIVERY.md.
